<section class="section" aria-labelledby="does-title">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="case-title" id="does-title">What it does for your business</h2>
    <div class="grid-2 case-features">
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Fast orders, at the table or the counter</h3><ul><li>Catalog by category with simple products, variants and combos.</li><li>Notes per item (“no sugar”, “lactose-free”).</li><li>Cancel items without redoing the order.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Tables with QR codes</h3><ul><li>Customers check their order from their phone, no app download needed.</li><li>Each table session is independent: bills never get mixed up.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Real-time kitchen and bar</h3><ul><li>Orders show up instantly on the preparation screen.</li><li>Live statuses: preparing, ready, delivered.</li><li>Fewer missed orders, fewer delays, better coordination.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Flexible payments</h3><ul><li>Multiple payment methods and exact bill splitting.</li><li>Tips and extra charges, with protection against double charges.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Inventory that updates itself</h3><ul><li>Every product has its own ingredient recipe.</li><li>Entries, exits and waste: you know where money is lost.</li></ul></article>
      <article class="card case-feature reveal"><h3>Invoicing, team and control</h3><ul><li>Instant PDF invoice, emailed with one click.</li><li>Roles: waiter, cashier, kitchen and administrator.</li><li>Built to run fast during rush hours.</li></ul></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
